WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:16.526
Tina: I can't believe how Danny and Brad are acting.

2
00:00:17.546 --> 00:00:18.627
They should know better.

3
00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:21.488
Tina: I can't believe Danny would fight with me!

4
00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:28.350
Billy: Tina cry?

5
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.912
Tina: I'm okay.

6
00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:34.585
Billy: Tina sad.

7
00:00:34.605 --> 00:00:37.906
Tina: Yes, I'm a little sad.

8
00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:44.329
Happy picture.

9
00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:47.270
Tina: You're so sweet.

10
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:50.571
Tina: I'm just sad about my friends.

11
00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:52.492
Billy: Brad and Danny!

12
00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:55.493
Tina: You like them, I know.

13
00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:59.235
Tina: But we we are having a fight.

14
00:00:59.255 --> 00:01:01.356
Billy: Why?

15
00:01:02.168 --> 00:01:04.169
Tina: Some mean boys hurt Danny.

16
00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.130
Danny is angry.

17
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.212
Billy: Grr!

18
00:01:08.252 --> 00:01:11.574
Tina: That's right.

19
00:01:12.214 --> 00:01:14.816
Now, Danny wants to hurt the mean boys.

20
00:01:14.836 --> 00:01:17.217
Billy: Hurt is bad!

21
00:01:17.237 --> 00:01:19.559
Tina: I think so too, Billy.

22
00:01:20.439 --> 00:01:22.020
I won't hurt the mean boys.

23
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.582
Tina: So, Danny and Brad aren't my friends right now.

24
00:01:26.843 --> 00:01:28.384
Billy: Tina sad.

25
00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:32.161
Tina: I'm sad because I don't know what to do.

26
00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:36.943
Dad: I'm sorry to hear that, sweetie.

27
00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.083
Tina: Dad!

28
00:01:38.523 --> 00:01:39.804
I didn't know you were there.

29
00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:41.805
Dad: I didn't mean to listen in.

30
00:01:41.825 --> 00:01:43.646
Tina: No, it's okay.

31
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:48.007
Dad: I'm proud of you for not wanting to hurt the mean boys.

32
00:01:48.027 --> 00:01:51.509
Tina: You've always said that it's not right to hurt people.

33
00:01:51.529 --> 00:01:53.950
Dad: These kids sound like bullies.

34
00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.190
Tina: They are.

35
00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:59.212
Tina: And now Danny is being just like them!

36
00:01:59.924 --> 00:02:01.605
He wants to bully the bullies.

37
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:05.368
Dad: I'm sure you can convince him it's a bad idea.

38
00:02:05.388 --> 00:02:08.190
Tina: I tried, Dad, but he won't listen!

39
00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:10.431
Dad: So you don't know what to do?

40
00:02:10.451 --> 00:02:13.253
Tina: Yeah, I'm stuck.

41
00:02:13.273 --> 00:02:15.855
Dad: Is there someone Danny respects?

42
00:02:16.956 --> 00:02:18.717
Tina: I thought he respected me.

43
00:02:18.737 --> 00:02:20.918
Dad: I'm sure he does.

44
00:02:20.938 --> 00:02:25.541
Dad: I mean, is there an older person that he might listen to?

45
00:02:25.561 --> 00:02:27.543
Tina: Older?

46
00:02:27.563 --> 00:02:29.044
Dad: Sure.

47
00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.242
You know, someone bigger.

48
00:02:31.262 --> 00:02:39.372
Tina: Someone bigger Dad: You've thought of someone, haven't you?

49
00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.935
Tina: I know the perfect person.

50
00:02:41.955 --> 00:02:45.339
Dad: So now there's no problem.

51
00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.642
Tina: Um, no.

52
00:02:47.922 --> 00:02:49.063
No problem at all
